\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us</strong>: <br>Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> This home boasts four beautifully designed bedrooms, each offering generous space, large windows for natural light, and scenic views, ensuring a serene personal retreat for each family member or guest.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathrooms:</strong> Includes two sophisticated bathrooms with contemporary fixtures and chic tile work, one of which is an en-suite providing privacy and luxury.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Areas:</strong> Two spacious living rooms provide flexible spaces for relaxation and entertainment. These areas are finished with top-notch materials and designed to foster a welcoming atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen and Dining:</strong> The heart of the home features a state-of-the-art kitchen with sleek stainless steel appliances and white stone countertops. The open-plan layout connects to the dining area, perfect for social gatherings or quiet family dinners.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Spaces:</strong> The property includes a tastefully landscaped garden and a deck, ideal for outdoor living and enjoying the tranquil surroundings of Niseko.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Parking:</strong> A secure garage with space for one vehicle, complemented by additional street parking.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Nestled in a serene neighborhood of Long bay in Auckland New Zealand, surrounded by breathtaking natural beauty, this home is not just a residence but a retreat from the bustling city life. </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspect-ratio&quot;:&quot;square&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6721c2d99aae8f5b8c9d486c&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;lightbox&quot;:false,&quot;padding&quot;:20,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;thumbnails-per-row&quot;:4,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;6721c2d99aae8f5b8c9d486c&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730258888192_275626\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"6721c2f6cdb3cb3edbe4cde0\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730265853039-UK5XXMRKOY1QKCNSPKPH/5+Makura+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%282%29.jpg\" alt=\"5 Makura Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (2).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"sys